---
import { Github, Mail, Rss } from "lucide-astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950">
  <div class="container grid gap-8 py-10 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]">
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{site.name}</p><p
        class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
      >
        {site.description}
      </p><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
        内容以 Git 管理；请以合法、合规和可验证的方式使用技术信息。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3" aria-label="联系链接">
      <a
        class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300"
        href={site.github}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
        aria-label="GitHub"><Github class="h-4 w-4" /></a
      >
      <a
        class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300"
        href={`mailto:${site.email}`}
        aria-label="邮箱"><Mail class="h-4 w-4" /></a
      >
      <a
        class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300"
        href="/rss.xml"
        aria-label="RSS"><Rss class="h-4 w-4" /></a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
